  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'SURVIVE THE IRON LONGHORN


    One truck rides at a time. Your normal
    forward/back and left/right controls counterlean the chassis; ACTION braces angular
    motion. The machine pitches, rolls, yaws, bucks and reverses, growing stronger
    over 60 seconds.


    Stay physically on the saddle. Earn 10 points per second,
    25 for recovering from a genuine dangerous tilt and 15 for each 10-second pattern
    survived. A real fall ends the ride; do not steer off deliberately. Everyone
    receives the same number of rides. Highest total wins; best survival breaks a
    tie.


    AI uses the same physical balance forces. Pause/help preserve the
    ride. Release controls before resuming.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
